      "content": "idk, i just don't see why people make it such a big deal. if a shadow disappears, nobody cries. if i just slipped away into all this nothingness, it’s not like i’m hurting the world. it feels more like just... completing a cycle. wouldn't that just be the most logical way to handle this kind of emptiness?",
